{"unit_id":"zytsyj__dsh-gpu#card-zh","repo":"zytsyj/dsh-gpu","commit":"bd74d556b3ccc527989117bd850eab18971c7014","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-gpu 是面向 DeepSeek Harness 的 GPU 执行插件，为 agent 提供显卡状态查询、按空闲程度选择显卡执行命令，以及启动和管理后台 GPU 作业的工具。它通过 DSH 的工具注册和 shell 执行接口工作，也可在合适的步骤注入 GPU 状态摘要。主要功能包括查看各卡显存、利用率与温度，执行单次或多卡命令，以及返回后台作业编号供后续查看或停止。适合在装有 NVIDIA GPU 的本地或远程执行环境中运行 CUDA 工作负载；需要执行主机提供 nvidia-smi，后台作业还需 jobs 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:242-269","src/index.ts:321-368","src/index.ts:390-451","src/index.ts:453-478"]}
{"unit_id":"zytsyj__dsh-gpu#card-en","repo":"zytsyj/dsh-gpu","commit":"bd74d556b3ccc527989117bd850eab18971c7014","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-gpu adds GPU tools to DeepSeek Harness: inspect device status, run commands on automatically selected or pinned GPUs, and launch background jobs. It uses the mounted shell and can inject a GPU summary into agent steps. The host needs nvidia-smi; background jobs require the jobs service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:242-269","src/index.ts:321-368","src/index.ts:390-451","src/index.ts:453-478"]}
